- *Medium anchor* — `huo8MqVH6t.md` (scores 6/5/8/3/6/8, accepted poster, avg ~6): Novel G-effect framework for analyzing LLM unlearning objectives, mechanistic gradient analysis, but with some overclaiming and presentation issues. Similar depth of mechanistic analysis to the paper under review.
- *High anchor* — `MGKDBuyv4p.md` (scores 8/6/8, accepted spotlight, avg ~7.3): Comprehensive memorization mitigation study with TinyMem, five new unlearning methods, thorough evaluation. Broader scope and cleaner methodology than this paper.

